	<!-- EN: The measure of the Settlement's overall loyalty.

The loyalty of a settlement determines how willing the settlement is to listen to you. A high loyalty will reduce the chance of defection.
	 -->
  <SettlementLoyaltyDesc>衡量领地居民是否忠诚的标准.忠诚度决定了内部冲突和解的意愿.高忠诚度可以减少叛逃的可能.</SettlementLoyaltyDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the Settlement's overall unrest.

The higher unrest grows, the more likely dangerous events internal in your Settlement will spark. Let it grow too high, and a Settlement-wide revolt may grow.
	 -->
  <SettlementUnrestDesc>衡量领地动荡程度的标准.动乱越严重,你的领地就越有可能发生危险事件.高叛乱度会增加内部冲突，过高的动乱度有可能引发领地规模的叛乱。</SettlementUnrestDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the Settlement's overall prosperity.

The prosperity of a town directly correlates with the production of resources (e.g. 50% prosperity = 50% production). Prosperity drifts toward a target determined by the settlement's happiness, loyalty, and unrest.
	 -->
  <SettlementProsperityDesc>衡量领地运行状况的标准。一个城镇的繁荣度与产量直接相关（50%繁荣度=50%产量）。繁荣度由幸福度，忠诚度，动乱度混合加权计算得到预期值。</SettlementProsperityDesc>

